# Implementation plan: OfflinePay AI

Your current backend is the foundation. I would preserve all five microservices and add only two new capabilities: PayPal funding and ML-assisted fraud detection. An AI investigation assistant can come later if time permits.

The PayPal AI Hackathon explicitly allows existing projects that are significantly updated during the submission period. It also requires a working demo and a public, licensed source-code repository.&#x20;

